    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against your friends and find out who is the best stomper of all time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 4 friends in this cute, yet chaotic competitive arena all about jumping and stomping to create waves that can damage your friends. Just don't forget to avoid THEIR waves if you wanna win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2770500/extras/b62232bda623f0f57b4587eb3e657a23.poster.avif?t=1750263459\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2770500/extras/b62232bda623f0f57b4587eb3e657a23.webm?t=1750263459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2770500/extras/b62232bda623f0f57b4587eb3e657a23.mp4?t=1750263459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Chaotic gameplay for up to 4 players </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different game modes, like deathmatch and point based matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many items that can turn the tide of the match in your favor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Online and offline modes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > And more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun with your friends and may the best stomper win!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against your friends and find out who is the best stomper of all time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 4 friends in this cute, yet chaotic competitive arena all about jumping and stomping to create waves that can damage your friends. Just don't forget to avoid THEIR waves if you wanna win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2770500/extras/b62232bda623f0f57b4587eb3e657a23.poster.avif?t=1750263459\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2770500/extras/b62232bda623f0f57b4587eb3e657a23.webm?t=1750263459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2770500/extras/b62232bda623f0f57b4587eb3e657a23.mp4?t=1750263459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Chaotic gameplay for up to 4 players </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different game modes, like deathmatch and point based matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many items that can turn the tide of the match in your favor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Online and offline modes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > And more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun with your friends and may the best stomper win!</p>",
